What this licence covers

The MIT licence above covers the Magmagat's own sources: the mg_*.gsc
scripts, its client script (csc/zm_prison_magmagat.csc), the tools under
tools/ (except the file named below) and the documentation.

It does not cover:

  - tools/oat/t6-fx-json.patch. It is a patch against OpenAssetTools
    (github.com/Laupetin/OpenAssetTools), so it is a derivative work of
    OpenAssetTools and is licensed under the GNU General Public License
    version 3 (GPL-3.0), as OpenAssetTools is.

  - The game data under tools/assets (asset lists, entity dumps, sound alias
    tables), extracted from Call of Duty: Black Ops II. It belongs to
    Activision / Treyarch. The mod's own manifests there (bo3_fx.tsv,
    bo3_sounds.tsv, bo4_sounds.tsv) are MIT like the tools.

  - The built mod: mod.ff and the sound bank (mod.all.sabl, mod.all.sabs) in
    a release. Their models, textures, materials, effects and sounds are
    other people's work and keep their owners' terms. None of them is under
    the MIT licence:
      - Treyarch / Activision assets from Black Ops II, Black Ops III and
        Black Ops 4: every model, texture, animation and sound, among them
        BO4's Magmagat and Tempered Blundergat models, the p8_fxp_magma_blob
        lava blob, the p8_zm_esc_machinery_01 press, BO4's skulls, lever and
        ghouls (with their animations), the Magmagat's sounds (its shot,
        reload, blob, burst and burning sounds), BO3's drums and lava, BO2's
        Blundergat reload animations, and the quest's sounds;
      - the effects of the BO3 Workshop map "MOB OF THE DEAD" by copforthat
        and the Mob of the Dead BO3 port team (_copforthat/_zm_prison/*),
        used with copforthat's permission;
      - Harry's effects that map ships (harry/magmagat/* and
        harry/blundersplat/*: the lava blob's trail, impact and burst, and
        the muzzle flashes).
